    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "First",
      "San Francisco to Sydney\nSupper\nOur Supper menu allows you flexibility to choose either our full menu after\ntake-off or to select from the menu at any time throughout your flight. Your\nFlight Attendant will be pleased to assist you.\nCanapés\nEntrées\nPotato and White Bean Soup with Olive Purée\nSeared Tuna with Tomato Ceviche\nLight Meals\nDuck Ragoût with Fresh Gnocchi\nBeef Burger with Smoked Mozzarella Cheese\nMain Courses\nVegetable Tagine with Almond Pilaf and Coriander Yoghurt\nSeared Sea Bass with Parsley Caper Sauce and Braised Roman Beans\nMarinated Lamb with Roast Pumpkin, Broccoli and Mint Jus\nA Rocket Salad is available to accompany your meal, or can be enjoyed as an\nentrée, dressed with your choice of Aged Balsamic Vinaigrette, Red Wine Vinaigrette,\nLemon Vinaigrette or Blue Cheese Dressing\nA choice of mustards and condiments is available\nCheese\nHand selected blue, soft and hard cheese served with accompaniments\nDessert\nSicilian Ricotta Cheesecake with Cream\nBaked Pear and Ginger Custard with Mascarpone\nIce Cream Tubs\nWhole or Sliced Fresh Seasonal Fruit\nPetits Fours\nChocolates\nPecan Fudge Slice"
    ],
